          "id": 7431807,
          "name": "Episode 3",
          "overview": "While the actors of 'Guardian: The Lonely And Great God' are enjoying their party to celebrate the 10th anniversary of their drama, they start a quiz hosted by In Na. The quiz is about common sense about the drama and its famous lines. The winner of this game will get a prize of Korean beef. From the beginning, Gong Yoo shows his competitive spirit, shouting out loud to get the chance. And the actors try to flatter In Na to get just a single point. Who will be the winner of this game?",
